WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.330 --> 00:00:02.130
 My therapist said
to me once, you know,

00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:04.710
Ru, the power you
have in drag is

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:07.110
available to you out of drag.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:09.190
Exsqueeze me?

00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.360
For years, I've said you're born
naked, and the rest is drag,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:15.540
meaning everything you
put on is, in essence,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:18.240
something that was
built. And once you're

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:21.180
able to see yourself
from outside of yourself,

00:00:21.180 --> 00:00:23.910
that's when the party begins.

00:00:23.910 --> 00:00:28.230
In this MasterClass, I'm going
to teach you about self-love,

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:34.320
confidence, joy, lips,
foundation, wigs, chiffon--

00:00:34.320 --> 00:00:39.600
everything it takes to unleash
the magic that makes you you.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.600
What you're going to see
is Raven show you, step

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:49.830
by step, what it takes to
get into real, glamazon drag.

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.170
Drag doesn't change who you are.

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:56.400
It actually reveals who you are.

00:00:56.400 --> 00:01:00.900
My childhood was very
tumultuous and traumatic.

00:01:00.900 --> 00:01:03.210
My parents were always at war.

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:08.220
So my thinking was, this
is all too much for me.

00:01:08.220 --> 00:01:10.350
Just wake me when it's done.

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:13.710
Until I realized, you know, I
want to be present for my life.

00:01:13.710 --> 00:01:17.790
And it forced me to
understand my own value.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:19.920
Everything starts
with know thyself.

00:01:19.920 --> 00:01:21.810
Know what works with you.

00:01:21.810 --> 00:01:26.430
You have to be present enough
to know what feels right.

00:01:26.430 --> 00:01:30.210
In drag, I feel so powerful.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:32.970
It is your life's work to shine.

00:01:32.970 --> 00:01:38.370
There is strength and power
in you, but it's up to you

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:39.720
to realize it.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.120
You were not born to fit in.

00:01:42.120 --> 00:01:44.820
You were born to stand out.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:49.220
I'm RuPaul, and this
is my MasterClass.

